     "Hi Mark,<br>I haven&#39;t seen that either. You&#39;re using my &#39;main&#39; cdf? I ran the <br>background correction on the tissue panel with the main cdf. I&#39;ve <br>scanned my results and searched for NAs and there don&#39;t appear to be <br>any. Was there anything in the verbose output from the background <br>correction?<br>Best,<br>Elizabeth"
